    'Hunter test quest‡Hunter test quest‡Hunter test quest‡Hunter test quest‡Hunter test quest‡Hunter test quest‡Hunter test quest‡Hunter test quest‡Hunter test quest',
    nil,
    'Feed your pet, then talk to your questgiver.‡Покормите своего питомца и поговорите с персонажем, который выдал это задание.‡Feed your pet, then talk to your questgiver.‡Feed your pet, then talk to your questgiver.‡Feed your pet, then talk to your questgiver.‡Feed your pet, then talk to your questgiver.‡Feed your pet, then talk to your questgiver.‡Feed your pet, then talk to your questgiver.‡餵你的寵物，然後和你的任務給予者對話。',
